  "keyFeatures": [
    "In-page JavaScript agent — no browser extension, Python, or headless browser needed",
    "Text-based DOM manipulation — no screenshots, no multimodal LLMs required",
    "Bring-your-own LLM via any OpenAI-compatible endpoint",
    "Custom tools via Zod schemas to extend agent capabilities with your own business logic",
    "Data masking via transformPageContent hook to protect sensitive user data",
    "Custom instructions (system-level and per-page) to guide agent behavior",
    "Chrome Extension for multi-page, multi-tab browser automation tasks",
    "MCP Server (Beta) to control the browser from Claude Desktop, Cursor, and other agent clients",
    "Lifecycle hooks: onBeforeTask, onAfterTask, onBeforeStep, onAfterStep, onDispose",
    "Re-Act agent loop with reflection-before-action mental model"
  ],
  "publicApiSurface": [
